<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Page not found &middot; DNSimple</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://cdn.dnsimple.com/favicon.ico">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
      background: #fff;
      color: #4a4a4a;
      font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-style: none; }

    a { color: #1a5ec6; }

    a:focus-visible, .btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid #1a5ec6;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .page { max-width: 40rem; margin: 0 auto; }

    .brand { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
    .brand img { width: 7.5rem; }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #979797;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.25rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #231f20;
    }

    p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .lead { font-size: 1.0625rem; }
    strong { color: #231f20; font-weight: 600; }

    .art { margin: 2.5rem 0 0; }
    .art img { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 26rem; margin: 0 auto; }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 2.25rem;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 0.25rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
      border: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #fff;
      color: #231f20;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: #fafafa; border-color: #cccccc; }

    .footnote {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      color: #979797;
    }
    .footnote a { color: #4a4a4a; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <a class="brand" href="/" title="DNSimple"><img src="https://cdn.dnsimple.com/assets/logos/dnsimple-logo-blue.svg" alt="DNSimple"></a>

    <p class="eyebrow">Error 404</p>
    <h1>Uh oh. We looked everywhere, but all we could find was this kitten.</h1>
    <p class="lead">We&rsquo;re sorry, we couldn&rsquo;t find the page you&rsquo;re looking for. So technically, this is our 404 page. But have no fear, you have some options below.</p>

    <figure class="art">
      <img src="https://cdn.dnsimple.com/assets/website/404.png" alt="An illustrated kitten beside a smiling machine labelled ROOT">
    </figure>

    <nav class="actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/">Home page</a>
      <a class="btn" href="javascript:history.go(-1);">Back to the previous page</a>
      <a class="btn" href="http://dnsimplestatus.com/">Status page</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/contact">Contact support</a>
    </nav>

    <p class="footnote">Hey, do you like comics? Us too! We made one <a href="https://howdns.works">explaining how DNS works</a>.</p>
  </main>

  <script>
    // A history link is a dead control with no history to return to.
    if (window.history.length <= 1) {
      var back = document.querySelector('a[href^="javascript:history"]');
      if (back) back.parentNode.removeChild(back);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
